{
 "id": "seg5a",
 "title": "回滚与Gas",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 96.14,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5a-00",
   "text": "最后一块基础，是 gas 和回滚。",
   "spoken": "最后一块基础，是 gas 和回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.216,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.995
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-01",
   "text": "每条指令都消耗 gas。gas 用完，当前调用帧回滚。",
   "spoken": "每条指令都消耗 gas。gas 用完，当前掉用帧回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.036,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 5.134,
   "speechEnd": 9.5
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-02",
   "text": "require 和自定义错误，会回滚当前调用，并向上冒泡。",
   "spoken": "require 和自定义错误，会回滚当前掉用，并向上冒泡。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.56,
   "dur": 4.992,
   "speechStart": 10.658,
   "speechEnd": 14.717
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-03",
   "text": "低级 call 失败却不冒泡，只返回 false 和返回数据。",
   "spoken": "低级 call 失败却不冒泡，只返回 false 和返回数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.772,
   "dur": 4.728,
   "speechStart": 15.87,
   "speechEnd": 19.667
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-04",
   "text": "try catch 只能接住外部调用的失败，接不住本合约内部的失败。",
   "spoken": "try catch 只能接住外部掉用的失败，接不住本合约内部的失败。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.72,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 20.818,
   "speechEnd": 25.068
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-05",
   "text": "外部调用，最多转发剩余 gas 的 64 分之 63。被调用方耗尽 gas，调用方还剩 64 分之 1 来收尾。",
   "spoken": "外部掉用，最多转发剩余 gas 的 64 分之 63。被掉用方耗尽 gas，掉用方还剩 64 分之 1 来收尾。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.124,
   "dur": 10.008,
   "speechStart": 26.222,
   "speechEnd": 35.279
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-06",
   "text": "这里有一个过时的习惯。transfer 和 send 只转发 2300 gas，曾经被当成防重入的手段。",
   "spoken": "这里有一个过时的习惯。transfer 和 send 只转发 2300 gas，曾经被荡成防虫入的手段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-06.mp3",
   "start": 36.352,
   "dur": 8.016,
   "speechStart": 36.45,
   "speechEnd": 43.519
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-07",
   "text": "后来 gas 价格改过几次。接收方是合约钱包时，这种转账会直接失败。",
   "spoken": "后来 gas 价格改过几次。接收方是合约钱包时，这种转账会直接失败。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-07.mp3",
   "start": 44.588,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 44.686,
   "speechEnd": 50.267
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-08",
   "text": "现在推荐的做法，是用 call 转账，再用 CEI 或重入锁来防重入。",
   "spoken": "现在推荐的做法，是用 call 转账，再用 CEI 或虫入锁来防虫入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-08.mp3",
   "start": 51.336,
   "dur": 6.264,
   "speechStart": 51.434,
   "speechEnd": 56.767
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-09",
   "text": "gas 规则还在变。Fusaka 和尚未上线的 Glamsterdam，都会打破固定 gas 够用的假设。",
   "spoken": "gas 规则还在变。Fusaka 和尚未上线的 Glamsterdam，都会打破固定 gas 够用的假设。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-09.mp3",
   "start": 57.82,
   "dur": 7.848,
   "speechStart": 57.918,
   "speechEnd": 64.82
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-10",
   "text": "编译器也在变。0.8 以前，算术默认不检查溢出，必须用 SafeMath。",
   "spoken": "编译器也在变。0.8 以前，算术默认不检查溢出，必须用 SafeMath。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-10.mp3",
   "start": 65.888,
   "dur": 6.864,
   "speechStart": 65.986,
   "speechEnd": 71.912
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-11",
   "text": "0.8.24 起，支持瞬态存储，可以做低成本的重入锁。跨链部署前，要确认目标链支持。",
   "spoken": "0.8.24 起，支持瞬态存储，可以做低成本的虫入锁。跨链部署前，要确认目标链支持。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-11.mp3",
   "start": 72.972,
   "dur": 8.736,
   "speechStart": 73.07,
   "speechEnd": 80.865
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-12",
   "text": "把这一集放在一起看，就是一句话：每一次调用，都可能把控制权交给别人。",
   "spoken": "把这一集放在一起看，就是一句话：每一次掉用，都可能把控制权交给别人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-12.mp3",
   "start": 81.928,
   "dur": 6.792,
   "speechStart": 82.026,
   "speechEnd": 87.883
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-13",
   "text": "交给了谁，用的是谁的存储，失败时谁回滚，都要自己看清楚。",
   "spoken": "交给了谁，用的是谁的存储，失败时谁回滚，都要自己看清楚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-13.mp3",
   "start": 88.94,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 89.038,
   "speechEnd": 94.109
  }
